{"id":"004e048b3416923c","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-coalgebra.md","title":"Coalgebra","display":"df-coalgebra — Coalgebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-coalgebra","aliases":["58-df-coalgebra","Coalgebra"],"display":"df-coalgebra — Coalgebra","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-tensor.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-algebraic-tensor-space-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-coalgebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-coalgebra</span><span>Coalgebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-coalgebra — Coalgebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md\">../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9bf75150bce95ccc\" href=\"?note=9bf75150bce95ccc\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-tensor.md\">../batch04/58-df-tensor.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"df67b9abe6db5f2c\" href=\"?note=df67b9abe6db5f2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-algebraic-tensor-space-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-algebraic-tensor-space-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,\\Delta,\\epsilon,k,+_C,\\odot_C,+_\\otimes,\\odot_\\otimes\\in V\">\\(C,\\Delta,\\epsilon,k,+_C,\\odot_C,+_\\otimes,\\odot_\\otimes\\in V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Coalgebra}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Coalgebra}_S\\)</span> 保留八元接口。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K=\\langle k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal K=\\langle k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\rangle\\)</span> 是域记录；下式中全部张量积采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TensorSpace}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{TensorSpace}_{58}\\)</span> 的固定线性结构。二元运算取有序对自变量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CoalgebraLawsData}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{CoalgebraLawsData}_{58}\\)</span> 定义余结合及余幺元等式；五元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CoalgebraTensorLaws}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{CoalgebraTensorLaws}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 是保留的存在投影接口。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Coalgebra}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Coalgebra}_S\\)</span> 使用显式结构版本，不把多个独立投影的见证混用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对有限记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle\">\\(\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pr}_i\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle=a_i\">\\(\\operatorname{pr}_i\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle=a_i\\)</span>。带结构记录的显式谓词中，运算及零元记号均缩写当前记录的对应分量；记录格式不满足时该谓词为假。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearData}\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearData}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"df67b9abe6db5f2c\" href=\"?note=df67b9abe6db5f2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-algebraic-tensor-space-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-algebraic-tensor-space-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CoalgebraLawsData}_{58}(C,\\Delta,\\epsilon,Q,\\iota,+_C,\\odot_C,+_Q,\\odot_Q,\\mathcal K)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal K=\\langle k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{TensorSpace}_{58}(Q,+_Q,\\odot_Q,\\iota;C,+_C,\\odot_C,C,+_C,\\odot_C,\\mathcal K)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{LinearData}_{58}(\\Delta,C,Q,k,+_C,\\odot_C,+_Q,\\odot_Q)\n\\land\\mathrm{LinearData}_{58}(\\epsilon,C,k,k,+_C,\\odot_C,+_k,\\cdot_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists T,+_T,\\odot_T,j,L,R,l,r\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{TensorSpace}_{58}(T,+_T,\\odot_T,j;C,+_C,\\odot_C,Q,+_Q,\\odot_Q,\\mathcal K)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{LinearData}_{58}(L,Q,T,k,+_Q,\\odot_Q,+_T,\\odot_T)\n\\land\\mathrm{LinearData}_{58}(R,Q,T,k,+_Q,\\odot_Q,+_T,\\odot_T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{LinearData}_{58}(l,Q,C,k,+_Q,\\odot_Q,+_C,\\odot_C)\n\\land\\mathrm{LinearData}_{58}(r,Q,C,k,+_Q,\\odot_Q,+_C,\\odot_C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in C\\;\\bigl(R(\\iota(x,y))=j(x,\\Delta(y))\n\\land l(\\iota(x,y))=\\odot_C(\\epsilon(x),y)\n\\land r(\\iota(x,y))=\\odot_C(\\epsilon(y),x)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall y\\in C\\;\\exists J\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{LinearData}_{58}(J,Q,T,k,+_Q,\\odot_Q,+_T,\\odot_T)\n\\land\\forall z,w\\in C\\;J(\\iota(z,w))=j(z,\\iota(w,y))\n\\land\\forall x\\in C\\;L(\\iota(x,y))=J(\\Delta(x))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in C\\;\\bigl(L(\\Delta(x))=R(\\Delta(x))\\land l(\\Delta(x))=x\\land r(\\Delta(x))=x\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CoalgebraLawsData}_{58}(C,\\Delta,\\epsilon,Q,\\iota,+_C,\\odot_C,+_Q,\\odot_Q,\\mathcal K)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal K=\\langle k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{TensorSpace}_{58}(Q,+_Q,\\odot_Q,\\iota;C,+_C,\\odot_C,C,+_C,\\odot_C,\\mathcal K)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{LinearData}_{58}(\\Delta,C,Q,k,+_C,\\odot_C,+_Q,\\odot_Q)\n\\land\\mathrm{LinearData}_{58}(\\epsilon,C,k,k,+_C,\\odot_C,+_k,\\cdot_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists T,+_T,\\odot_T,j,L,R,l,r\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{TensorSpace}_{58}(T,+_T,\\odot_T,j;C,+_C,\\odot_C,Q,+_Q,\\odot_Q,\\mathcal K)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{LinearData}_{58}(L,Q,T,k,+_Q,\\odot_Q,+_T,\\odot_T)\n\\land\\mathrm{LinearData}_{58}(R,Q,T,k,+_Q,\\odot_Q,+_T,\\odot_T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{LinearData}_{58}(l,Q,C,k,+_Q,\\odot_Q,+_C,\\odot_C)\n\\land\\mathrm{LinearData}_{58}(r,Q,C,k,+_Q,\\odot_Q,+_C,\\odot_C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in C\\;\\bigl(R(\\iota(x,y))=j(x,\\Delta(y))\n\\land l(\\iota(x,y))=\\odot_C(\\epsilon(x),y)\n\\land r(\\iota(x,y))=\\odot_C(\\epsilon(y),x)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall y\\in C\\;\\exists J\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{LinearData}_{58}(J,Q,T,k,+_Q,\\odot_Q,+_T,\\odot_T)\n\\land\\forall z,w\\in C\\;J(\\iota(z,w))=j(z,\\iota(w,y))\n\\land\\forall x\\in C\\;L(\\iota(x,y))=J(\\Delta(x))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in C\\;\\bigl(L(\\Delta(x))=R(\\Delta(x))\\land l(\\Delta(x))=x\\land r(\\Delta(x))=x\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Coalgebra}_S(C,\\Delta,\\epsilon;k,+_C,\\odot_C,+_\\otimes,\\odot_\\otimes)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\mathcal K,Q,\\iota\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{pr}_0\\mathcal K=k\n\\land\\mathrm{CoalgebraLawsData}_{58}(C,\\Delta,\\epsilon,Q,\\iota,+_C,\\odot_C,+_\\otimes,\\odot_\\otimes,\\mathcal K)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Coalgebra}_S(C,\\Delta,\\epsilon;k,+_C,\\odot_C,+_\\otimes,\\odot_\\otimes)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\mathcal K,Q,\\iota\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{pr}_0\\mathcal K=k\n\\land\\mathrm{CoalgebraLawsData}_{58}(C,\\Delta,\\epsilon,Q,\\iota,+_C,\\odot_C,+_\\otimes,\\odot_\\otimes,\\mathcal K)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CoalgebraTensorLaws}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(C,\\Delta,\\epsilon,k,Q)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\mathcal K,\\iota,+_C,\\odot_C,+_Q,\\odot_Q\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{pr}_0\\mathcal K=k\n\\land\\mathrm{CoalgebraLawsData}_{58}(C,\\Delta,\\epsilon,Q,\\iota,+_C,\\odot_C,+_Q,\\odot_Q,\\mathcal K)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CoalgebraTensorLaws}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(C,\\Delta,\\epsilon,k,Q)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\mathcal K,\\iota,+_C,\\odot_C,+_Q,\\odot_Q\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{pr}_0\\mathcal K=k\n\\land\\mathrm{CoalgebraLawsData}_{58}(C,\\Delta,\\epsilon,Q,\\iota,+_C,\\odot_C,+_Q,\\odot_Q,\\mathcal K)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>规范诱导映射由其纯张量值及线性条件刻画；余结合和两条余幺元条件均在 Assertion 中，不再依赖自然语言图式。旧八元及五元接口保留。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Sweedler, Hopf Algebras</li>\n<li>Montgomery, Hopf Algebras and Their Actions on Rings</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"f67456d74b418241","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-tensor.md","status":"resolved","id":"9bf75150bce95ccc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-tensor.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-algebraic-tensor-space-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"df67b9abe6db5f2c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-algebraic-tensor-space-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-algebraic-tensor-space-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"df67b9abe6db5f2c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{LinearData}$ 取 [[../batch04/58-df-algebraic-tensor-space-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C,\\Delta,\\epsilon,k,+_C,\\odot_C,+_\\otimes,\\odot_\\otimes\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Coalgebra}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K=\\langle k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TensorSpace}_{58}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CoalgebraLawsData}_{58}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CoalgebraTensorLaws}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Coalgebra}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pr}_i\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle=a_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinearData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CoalgebraLawsData}_{58}(C,\\Delta,\\epsilon,Q,\\iota,+_C,\\odot_C,+_Q,\\odot_Q,\\mathcal K)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathcal K=\\langle k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{TensorSpace}_{58}(Q,+_Q,\\odot_Q,\\iota;C,+_C,\\odot_C,C,+_C,\\odot_C,\\mathcal K)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{LinearData}_{58}(\\Delta,C,Q,k,+_C,\\odot_C,+_Q,\\odot_Q)\n\\land\\mathrm{LinearData}_{58}(\\epsilon,C,k,k,+_C,\\odot_C,+_k,\\cdot_k)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists T,+_T,\\odot_T,j,L,R,l,r\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{TensorSpace}_{58}(T,+_T,\\odot_T,j;C,+_C,\\odot_C,Q,+_Q,\\odot_Q,\\mathcal K)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{LinearData}_{58}(L,Q,T,k,+_Q,\\odot_Q,+_T,\\odot_T)\n\\land\\mathrm{LinearData}_{58}(R,Q,T,k,+_Q,\\odot_Q,+_T,\\odot_T)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{LinearData}_{58}(l,Q,C,k,+_Q,\\odot_Q,+_C,\\odot_C)\n\\land\\mathrm{LinearData}_{58}(r,Q,C,k,+_Q,\\odot_Q,+_C,\\odot_C)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y\\in C\\;\\bigl(R(\\iota(x,y))=j(x,\\Delta(y))\n\\land l(\\iota(x,y))=\\odot_C(\\epsilon(x),y)\n\\land r(\\iota(x,y))=\\odot_C(\\epsilon(y),x)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall y\\in C\\;\\exists J\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{LinearData}_{58}(J,Q,T,k,+_Q,\\odot_Q,+_T,\\odot_T)\n\\land\\forall z,w\\in C\\;J(\\iota(z,w))=j(z,\\iota(w,y))\n\\land\\forall x\\in C\\;L(\\iota(x,y))=J(\\Delta(x))\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in C\\;\\bigl(L(\\Delta(x))=R(\\Delta(x))\\land l(\\Delta(x))=x\\land r(\\Delta(x))=x\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Coalgebra}_S(C,\\Delta,\\epsilon;k,+_C,\\odot_C,+_\\otimes,\\odot_\\otimes)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists\\mathcal K,Q,\\iota\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{pr}_0\\mathcal K=k\n\\land\\mathrm{CoalgebraLawsData}_{58}(C,\\Delta,\\epsilon,Q,\\iota,+_C,\\odot_C,+_\\otimes,\\odot_\\otimes,\\mathcal K)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CoalgebraTensorLaws}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(C,\\Delta,\\epsilon,k,Q)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists\\mathcal K,\\iota,+_C,\\odot_C,+_Q,\\odot_Q\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{pr}_0\\mathcal K=k\n\\land\\mathrm{CoalgebraLawsData}_{58}(C,\\Delta,\\epsilon,Q,\\iota,+_C,\\odot_C,+_Q,\\odot_Q,\\mathcal K)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3596,"backlinks":[{"id":"df38af7e4180f1bc","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{CoalgebraLawsData}$ 取 [[58-df-coalgebra]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-298","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-coalgebra.md|58-df-coalgebra]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["592f9cfb66a507c2","f67456d74b418241","9bf75150bce95ccc","1eb4a89b005d9cda","df